            "Antler has no ancient tradition in crystal healing as such, but it is a powerful symbol of renewal, strength and regeneration in Celtic and shamanic cultures, because it regrows every year. It is worn as an amulet of protection and connection with nature. It is associated with the root chakra and the sign of Sagittarius. Avoid prolonged water and dry heat, which split it; nourish it occasionally with a little oil or wax; cleanse by smudging."
